{"id": "rijks-20026482", "status": "ok", "meta": "An old woman sits by the hearth with a cat on her lap and her feet on a foot warmer, a small painting by August Allebé.", "about": "An old woman sits by the hearth with a cat in her lap and her feet on a foot warmer. August Allebé painted this small picture and gave it to his brother Gerard and Gerard's wife Wilhelmina as a wedding gift in 1875. Wilhelmina left it to the Rijksmuseum in 1936.", "museum_record": "https://www.rijksmuseum.nl/nl/collectie/object/SK-A-3267--ed018d18d777183b6d91deaac331e1df", "inventory_number": "", "dimensions": "", "credit_line": "", "sources": ["https://www.rijksmuseum.nl/nl/collectie/object/SK-A-3267--ed018d18d777183b6d91deaac331e1df", "https://id.rijksmuseum.nl/20026482"], "check": "clean"}
